        {
          "accepts_file_upload": true,
          "accepts_variable_reference": true,
          "description": "Files the agent can search when it needs to: a handbook, a price list, past tickets, a contract. Attach them once and Lodol makes them searchable; the agent looks up the passages that matter instead of reading everything. PDF, Word, text, Markdown, CSV, Excel and JSON files, up to 10 MB each and 20 in all. Works with any model, and needs a connection to OpenAI, Google Gemini, Mistral AI or Cohere for the searching.",
