          "name": "instructions",
          "required": false,
          "type": "ParameterType.STRING"
        },
        {
          "description": "What the agent may use: actions from your apps, such as reading a page or writing a row, Lodol's own steps, such as Call an API, Run Python code or the date steps, and your own published workflows. Actions run with this workspace's connections, so connect the app first. Fix any input you do not want the agent to choose, such as which spreadsheet to write to or which mail server to send from, and mark a tool Ask first to have a person approve each use before it runs. Keep the list short and relevant.",
          "display_name": "Tools",
          "name": "tools",
          "required": false,
          "type": "ParameterType.ARRAY"
        },
        {
          "default": false,
          "description": "Let the agent search the web through its AI provider's own search, with no search app to connect. Works with a model from Anthropic, OpenAI, Google Gemini, OpenRouter or Qwen; each search is billed by the provider to your account, with the model's own usage.",
